{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42990","headline":"敕和元相公家园即事寄王相公 · 韩雄","name":"敕和元相公家园即事寄王相公","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"共列中台贵，能齐物外心。\n回车青阁晚，解带碧芳深。\n夜水随畦入，晴花度竹寻。\n题诗更相应，一字重千金。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩雄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42990.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42990","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}